  "fanType": 4,
  "level": "상",
  "kind": "주관식",
  "body": "$a=\\sqrt[6]{3-\\sqrt{5}}$ 일 때, $\\dfrac{a^{-2}+a^{-4}+a^{-6}+a^{-8}+a^{-10}}{a^2+a^4+a^6+a^8+a^{10}}$ 의 값을 구하시오.",
  "choices": [],
  "answer": "$\\dfrac{7+3\\sqrt{5}}{8}$",
  "figure": null,
  "solution": "$\\dfrac{a^{-2}+a^{-4}+a^{-6}+a^{-8}+a^{-10}}{a^2+a^4+a^6+a^8+a^{10}}$\n$=\\dfrac{a^{-10}(a^8+a^6+a^4+a^2+1)}{a^2(1+a^2+a^4+a^6+a^8)}$\n$=\\dfrac{a^{-10}}{a^2}=a^{-12}$\n$=\\left(\\sqrt[6]{3-\\sqrt{5}}\\right)^{-12}=(3-\\sqrt{5})^{-2}$\n$=\\dfrac{1}{(3-\\sqrt{5})^2}=\\dfrac{1}{14-6\\sqrt{5}}$\n$=\\dfrac{14+6\\sqrt{5}}{(14-6\\sqrt{5})(14+6\\sqrt{5})}=\\dfrac{14+6\\sqrt{5}}{16}$\n$=\\dfrac{7+3\\sqrt{5}}{8}$ 이다.",
  "parent": "",
  "variant": ""
 },
 {
